@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@plant = PLANT-EXAMPLE-001
@device = INV-EXAMPLE-1

### Ganti plant/device dengan identitas yang dikembalikan inventory.
GET {{base}}/api/database/power-statistics?plant_code={{plant}}&from=2026-11-11T17:00:00Z&to=2026-11-12T17:00:00Z&time_zone=Asia/Jakarta&resolution_minutes=10&aggregation=average

### Total laporan sebelum pagination tersedia di response.totals.
GET {{base}}/api/reports/inverters?plant_code={{plant}}&from=2026-11-11T17:00:00Z&to=2026-11-12T17:00:00Z&time_zone=Asia/Jakarta&grain=hour&page=1&page_size=100

### Ambil seluruh meta.total_pages untuk ekspor perangkat.
GET {{base}}/api/devices/{{device}}/history?plant_code={{plant}}&from=2026-11-11T17:00:00Z&to=2026-11-12T17:00:00Z&time_zone=Asia/Jakarta&page=1&page_size=1000
